sequenceDiagram
 actor P as Patient
 participant UI as Web frontend
 participant AI as AISchedulingAdapter
 participant L as Language model API
 participant V as AvailabilityService
 P->>UI: Enter scheduling preferences
 UI->>AI: suggest(patientId, text)
 AI->>AI: interpret(text)
 AI->>L: Scheduling-only prompt with structured output
 L-->>AI: intent and confidence
 alt Valid intent and confidence at least 0.70
  AI->>V: findOpen(intent)
  V-->>AI: current provider and slot options
  AI-->>UI: available options or no matches
  UI-->>P: Show options for patient selection
 else Low confidence or incomplete preferences
  AI-->>UI: clarification required
  UI-->>P: Ask for provider or date preference
 end
 Note over P,UI: Booking requires a separate confirmed book() request
